<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1863898793"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:59.827" ttm:agent="v2"><div begin="22.783" end="44.073" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="22.783" end="24.668" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.783" end="23.551">多少夜我</span><span begin="23.551" end="24.668">再次点燃曙光</span></p><p begin="24.828" end="26.081" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.828" end="25.806">黑暗无法阻</span><span begin="25.806" end="26.081">挡</span></p><p begin="26.552" end="27.991" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.552" end="27.191">划开天</span><span begin="27.191" end="27.371">际</span><span begin="27.371" end="27.991">线</span></p><p begin="27.991" end="30.219" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.991" end="28.978">没人拥有这份</span><span begin="28.978" end="29.709">赐予我的</span><span begin="29.709" end="30.219">能量</span></p><p begin="30.263" end="32.025" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.263" end="31.027">就算一直</span><span begin="31.027" end="31.575">在改</span><span begin="31.575" end="32.025">变</span></p><p begin="32.035" end="35.289" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.035" end="33.080">回头看背后的</span><span begin="33.080" end="33.432">丰</span><span begin="33.432" end="34.000">碑</span> <span begin="34.403" end="34.776">屹立</span><span begin="34.776" end="35.289">着</span></p><p begin="35.573" end="38.783" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.573" end="35.762">像</span><span begin="35.762" end="36.210">纯</span><span begin="36.210" end="36.682">粹</span><span begin="36.943" end="37.547">又甜美</span><span begin="37.547" end="37.879">的</span><span begin="37.879" end="38.255">干</span><span begin="38.255" end="38.783">果</span></p><p begin="39.083" end="44.073" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.083" end="39.588">终</span><span begin="39.588" end="40.044">会</span><span begin="40.311" end="40.751">伴我</span><span begin="40.751" end="40.961">入</span><span begin="40.961" end="41.617">睡</span> <span begin="42.104" end="42.574">生</span><span begin="42.574" end="43.184">死与</span><span begin="43.184" end="44.073">共</span></p></div><div begin="43.426" end="1:05.213" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="43.426" end="46.323" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="43.426" end="44.086">我早已经</span> <span begin="44.306" end="45.187">知道圣诞老人</span><span begin="45.187" end="45.710">不会凭空</span><span begin="45.710" end="45.918">出</span><span begin="45.918" end="46.323">现</span></p><p begin="46.333" end="48.844" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="46.333" end="47.357">他就像海市蜃楼</span><span begin="47.357" end="47.977">摸不清影踪</span><span begin="47.977" end="48.484">忽隐忽</span><span begin="48.484" end="48.844">现</span></p><p begin="48.854" end="51.597" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="48.854" end="49.046">我</span><span begin="49.046" end="49.855">发出了争取的</span><span begin="49.855" end="50.233">信号</span> <span begin="50.233" end="50.763">那一刻像</span><span begin="50.763" end="51.162">基因突</span><span begin="51.162" end="51.597">变</span></p><p begin="51.611" end="54.281" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="51.611" end="52.544">而成功的代价</span><span begin="52.544" end="53.603">就是向过去寄出</span><span begin="53.603" end="53.755">的</span><span begin="53.755" end="53.953">书</span><span begin="53.953" end="54.281">柬</span></p><p begin="54.507" end="57.199" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="54.507" end="55.056">不同的字</span><span begin="55.056" end="55.418">词</span> <span begin="55.418" end="56.096">我有我的用</span><span begin="56.096" end="56.324">法</span> <span begin="56.324" end="56.799">我会洞</span><span begin="56.799" end="57.199">察</span></p><p begin="57.229" end="59.786" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="57.229" end="58.330">你说我忘了根源</span> <span begin="58.330" end="58.485">那</span> <span begin="58.485" end="59.296">我在为了什麼</span><span begin="59.296" end="59.458">奋</span><span begin="59.458" end="59.786">发</span></p><p begin="59.796" end="1:01.627" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="59.796" end="1:00.692">尽管沙漠戈壁</span><span begin="1:00.692" end="1:01.627">离我越来越远了</span></p><p begin="1:01.637" end="1:02.638" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:01.637" end="1:01.820">But</span> <span begin="1:01.820" end="1:01.988">I</span> <span begin="1:01.988" end="1:02.146">don't</span> <span begin="1:02.146" end="1:02.327">give</span> <span begin="1:02.327" end="1:02.638">a</span></p><p begin="1:02.648" end="1:05.213" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:02.648" end="1:03.046">他们在</span><span begin="1:03.046" end="1:03.724">人云亦云</span> <span begin="1:03.724" end="1:04.102">所以我</span><span begin="1:04.102" end="1:04.454">凭什麼</span><span begin="1:04.454" end="1:04.752">还去</span><span begin="1:04.752" end="1:04.915">记</span><span begin="1:04.915" end="1:05.213">恨</span></p></div><div begin="1:05.410" end="1:27.195" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:05.410" end="1:08.101" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:05.410" end="1:05.760">职业在</span><span begin="1:05.760" end="1:06.146">发展</span> <span begin="1:06.146" end="1:07.386">现在又到了新的阶段</span> <span begin="1:07.386" end="1:08.101">我还在守望</span></p><p begin="1:08.111" end="1:10.722" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:08.111" end="1:08.677">这个跟股</span><span begin="1:08.677" end="1:08.892">票</span><span begin="1:08.892" end="1:09.244">一样的</span><span begin="1:09.244" end="1:09.542">行当</span> <span begin="1:09.542" end="1:10.059">红绿色</span><span begin="1:10.059" end="1:10.203">的</span><span begin="1:10.203" end="1:10.387">走</span><span begin="1:10.387" end="1:10.722">向</span></p><p begin="1:10.732" end="1:13.519" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:10.732" end="1:11.113">再碰</span><span begin="1:11.113" end="1:11.483">杯</span> <span begin="1:11.511" end="1:12.756">浓烈又直接就像</span><span begin="1:12.756" end="1:13.094">烧酒</span><span begin="1:13.094" end="1:13.519">烫</span></p><p begin="1:13.577" end="1:16.318" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:13.577" end="1:13.780">拿</span><span begin="1:13.780" end="1:13.922">起</span><span begin="1:13.922" end="1:14.061">过</span> <span begin="1:14.061" end="1:14.544">我也敢扔</span><span begin="1:14.544" end="1:14.768">下</span> <span begin="1:14.856" end="1:15.390">因为船</span><span begin="1:15.390" end="1:15.567">票</span><span begin="1:15.567" end="1:15.896">在我手</span><span begin="1:15.896" end="1:16.318">上</span></p><p begin="1:16.327" end="1:18.865" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:16.327" end="1:16.723">命运的</span><span begin="1:16.723" end="1:17.023">邮轮</span> <span begin="1:17.023" end="1:17.665">又将去往</span><span begin="1:17.665" end="1:18.000">下一个</span><span begin="1:18.000" end="1:18.351">未知的</span><span begin="1:18.351" end="1:18.555">海</span><span begin="1:18.555" end="1:18.865">岸</span></p><p begin="1:19.000" end="1:21.641" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:19.000" end="1:19.333">善良</span><span begin="1:19.333" end="1:19.709">换得了</span><span begin="1:19.709" end="1:19.927">快</span><span begin="1:19.927" end="1:20.186">乐</span> <span begin="1:20.240" end="1:20.850">当然也能靠</span><span begin="1:20.850" end="1:21.306">真金百</span><span begin="1:21.306" end="1:21.641">万</span></p><p begin="1:21.641" end="1:24.336" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:21.641" end="1:22.485">也不会再较真</span><span begin="1:22.485" end="1:23.078">过去的错</span><span begin="1:23.078" end="1:23.202">误</span> <span begin="1:23.202" end="1:24.034">不可能纠正改</span><span begin="1:24.034" end="1:24.336">判</span></p><p begin="1:24.346" end="1:27.195" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:24.346" end="1:25.044">但路依然</span><span begin="1:25.044" end="1:25.228">在</span><span begin="1:25.228" end="1:25.379">脚</span><span begin="1:25.379" end="1:25.715">下</span> <span begin="1:25.715" end="1:26.558">有些羁绊必须</span><span begin="1:26.558" end="1:26.867">趁早</span><span begin="1:26.867" end="1:27.095">踩</span><span begin="1:27.095" end="1:27.195">断</span></p></div><div begin="1:27.195" end="2:00.151" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:27.195" end="1:29.926" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:27.195" end="1:27.878">有太多无厘</span><span begin="1:27.878" end="1:28.241">头</span> <span begin="1:28.241" end="1:29.176">世俗和桎梏</span><span begin="1:29.176" end="1:29.606">来的无理</span><span begin="1:29.606" end="1:29.926">由</span></p><p begin="1:29.926" end="1:32.690" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:29.926" end="1:30.312">骨子里</span><span begin="1:30.312" end="1:30.729">头</span> <span begin="1:30.729" end="1:31.389">可否忠贞</span><span begin="1:31.389" end="1:32.362">还能甘为孺子</span><span begin="1:32.362" end="1:32.690">牛</span></p><p begin="1:32.690" end="1:33.534" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:32.690" end="1:32.790">I</span> <span begin="1:32.790" end="1:32.909">felling</span> <span begin="1:32.909" end="1:33.093">so</span> <span begin="1:33.093" end="1:33.534">cold</span></p><p begin="1:33.667" end="1:35.431" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:33.667" end="1:34.425">用我的热情</span><span begin="1:34.425" end="1:35.278">够不够融化冰</span><span begin="1:35.278" end="1:35.431">冻</span></p><p begin="1:35.441" end="1:38.340" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:35.441" end="1:35.633">猜</span><span begin="1:35.633" end="1:35.779">不</span><span begin="1:35.779" end="1:36.091">透</span> <span begin="1:36.091" end="1:36.533">所以才</span><span begin="1:36.533" end="1:37.178">亲自赶赴</span><span begin="1:37.178" end="1:37.812">而不是盲目</span><span begin="1:37.812" end="1:38.031">听</span><span begin="1:38.031" end="1:38.340">从</span></p><p begin="1:38.350" end="1:40.748" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:38.350" end="1:38.561">没把</span><span begin="1:38.561" end="1:39.568">任何人当对手</span> <span begin="1:39.568" end="1:39.880">所以我</span><span begin="1:39.880" end="1:40.382">才能胜</span><span begin="1:40.382" end="1:40.748">利</span></p><p begin="1:40.780" end="1:43.396" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:40.780" end="1:40.924">但</span><span begin="1:40.924" end="1:41.243">邪恶</span><span begin="1:41.243" end="1:41.626">对立面</span><span begin="1:41.626" end="1:42.178">也有阴暗</span> <span begin="1:42.178" end="1:42.849">也可能伪装</span><span begin="1:42.849" end="1:43.073">正</span><span begin="1:43.073" end="1:43.396">义</span></p><p begin="1:43.534" end="1:46.203" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:43.534" end="1:44.279">以前我爱得</span><span begin="1:44.279" end="1:44.958">太极端了</span> <span begin="1:44.958" end="1:45.690">直到我产生</span><span begin="1:45.690" end="1:45.825">恨</span><span begin="1:45.825" end="1:46.203">意</span></p><p begin="1:46.271" end="1:49.035" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:46.271" end="1:46.684">现在才</span><span begin="1:46.684" end="1:47.372">顿悟透彻</span> <span begin="1:47.372" end="1:48.130">为那些宝贵的时</span><span begin="1:48.130" end="1:48.331">光</span><span begin="1:48.331" end="1:48.605">痛</span><span begin="1:48.605" end="1:49.035">惜</span></p><p begin="1:49.045" end="1:51.593" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:49.045" end="1:49.614">一撇一</span><span begin="1:49.614" end="1:49.842">捺</span> <span begin="1:49.842" end="1:50.012">坚</span><span begin="1:50.012" end="1:50.377">守</span><span begin="1:50.377" end="1:51.296">才是我信奉的主</span><span begin="1:51.296" end="1:51.593">义</span></p><p begin="1:51.593" end="1:54.359" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:51.593" end="1:52.802">不再轻易伤害任何</span><span begin="1:52.802" end="1:53.010">人</span> <span begin="1:53.010" end="1:53.830">用任何形式的</span><span begin="1:53.830" end="1:54.003">武</span><span begin="1:54.003" end="1:54.359">器</span></p><p begin="1:54.359" end="1:57.085" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:54.359" end="1:54.694">而努</span><span begin="1:54.694" end="1:54.998">力</span><span begin="1:55.136" end="1:55.816">的确是虚荣</span><span begin="1:55.816" end="1:55.954">的</span> <span begin="1:55.954" end="1:56.517">我